stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Present: cursor at verified EOF
    Present --> Present: optional append beyond durable cursor
    Present --> Missing: external archive removes original
    Missing --> Retired: archive exists and retained FD verifies durable EOF
    Missing --> Halted: missing proof or unread tail
    Retired --> Retired: restart retains durable retirement
    Retired --> Attached: next normal binding attaches new source
